{"id":"19c8ea5f8ad3f6d0","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-bm-second-local-category.md","title":"BM 中 II 必胜的局部稀疏刻画","display":"thm-bm-second-local-category — BM 中 II 必胜的局部稀疏刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-bm-second-local-category","aliases":["20-thm-bm-second-local-category"],"display":"thm-bm-second-local-category — BM 中 II 必胜的局部稀疏刻画","chapter":"14","section":"14.1.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 14.1.3 括号陈述按先手约定修正","source_printed_pages":[212,213],"source_pdf_pages":[241,242],"depends_on":["[[20-df-bm-strategy]]","[[20-df-relative-category]]","[[20-thm-banach-mazur]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-bm-second-local-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-bm-second-local-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bm-second-local-category — BM 中 II 必胜的局部稀疏刻画"},{"key":"chapter","html":"14"},{"key":"section","html":"14.1.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 14.1.3 括号陈述按先手约定修正"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>212</span><span>213</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>241</span><span>242</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dbd3c82cd2473f13\" href=\"?note=dbd3c82cd2473f13\" title=\"20-df-bm-strategy\">20-df-bm-strategy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60e50068702b03cb\" href=\"?note=60e50068702b03cb\" title=\"20-df-relative-category\">20-df-relative-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c989c60a7c30291e\" href=\"?note=c989c60a7c30291e\" title=\"20-thm-banach-mazur\">20-thm-banach-mazur</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；相对稀疏性采用柱集的诱导拓扑。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dbd3c82cd2473f13\" href=\"?note=dbd3c82cd2473f13\" title=\"20-df-bm-strategy\">20-df-bm-strategy</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"60e50068702b03cb\" href=\"?note=60e50068702b03cb\" title=\"20-df-relative-category\">20-df-relative-category</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c989c60a7c30291e\" href=\"?note=c989c60a7c30291e\" title=\"20-thm-banach-mazur\">20-thm-banach-mazur</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bm-second-local-category}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,II}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [|\\sigma|&gt;0\\land\\operatorname{Meager}_{[\\sigma]}(A\\cap[\\sigma])].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bm-second-local-category}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,II}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [|\\sigma|&gt;0\\land\\operatorname{Meager}_{[\\sigma]}(A\\cap[\\sigma])].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若右侧成立，II 首次选择该柱，之后依次进入其相对稠密开集，最终点避开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。反向，固定 II 胜策首次选的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，余下博弈在该柱中由 I 首先任意延伸、II 响应。这是同一 BM 模型中的目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\sigma]\\setminus A\">\\([\\sigma]\\setminus A\\)</span>、角色互换：柱 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\sigma]\">\\([\\sigma]\\)</span> 与 Cantor 空间同胚，I 方胜策–comeager 刻画使该补集在柱内 comeager，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 局部 meager。无需预先假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 有 Baire 性质。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 14.1.3 括号陈述按先手约定修正；印刷页 212, 213；PDF 第 241, 242 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-bm-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"dbd3c82cd2473f13","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-bm-strategy]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-relative-category","status":"resolved","id":"60e50068702b03cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-relative-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-banach-mazur","status":"resolved","id":"c989c60a7c30291e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-banach-mazur]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-bm-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"dbd3c82cd2473f13","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]；see [[20-df-relative-category]]；see [[20-thm-banach-mazur]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-relative-category","status":"resolved","id":"60e50068702b03cb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]；see [[20-df-relative-category]]；see [[20-thm-banach-mazur]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-banach-mazur","status":"resolved","id":"c989c60a7c30291e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]；see [[20-df-relative-category]]；see [[20-thm-banach-mazur]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bm-second-local-category}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,II}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\ [|\\sigma|>0\\land\\operatorname{Meager}_{[\\sigma]}(A\\cap[\\sigma])].","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"[\\sigma]\\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1703,"backlinks":[{"id":"c989c60a7c30291e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书后手括号等价式已由 [[20-thm-bm-second-local-category]] 按首步约定订正；这里不将纯导航链接反列为上游依赖。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-bm-second-local-category]] — 章 14；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-bm-second-local-category]]"}],"outgoing":["dbd3c82cd2473f13","60e50068702b03cb","c989c60a7c30291e"]}